- [API reference (docs.rs)](https://docs.rs/paigasus-helikon-macros)
- [Guide & concepts](https://smk1085.github.io/paigasus-helikon/) — see [tools](https://smk1085.github.io/paigasus-helikon/concepts/tools.html)
